<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-PHILIPPOUSSIS WINS TOULOUSE GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PHILIPPOUSSIS WINS TOULOUSE GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>TOULOUSE, France 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final result in the</p>
<p>$400,000 men's Toulouse indoor tennis Grand Prix on Sunday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat Magnus Larsson (Sweden)</p>
<p>6-1 5-7 6-4.</p>
</text>
